# Real Partiful integration (optional, read-only mutuals).
# Partiful has no official API, so you lend the app your own browser session.
# Without these the app still runs — it just falls back to mock mutuals.
#
# How to get these values:
#   1. Log in to https://partiful.com in Chrome.
#   2. Open DevTools (Cmd+Opt+I) -> Application tab.
#   3. IndexedDB -> firebaseLocalStorageDb -> firebaseLocalStorage.
#   4. Expand the "fbase_key ... " entry -> value.
#        - apiKey                       -> PARTIFUL_FIREBASE_API_KEY
#        - uid                          -> PARTIFUL_USER_ID
#        - stsTokenManager.refreshToken -> PARTIFUL_REFRESH_TOKEN
#
# The refresh token is tied to your session and expires; re-paste when the
# app says it disconnected.

PARTIFUL_REFRESH_TOKEN=
PARTIFUL_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
PARTIFUL_USER_ID=
# PARTIFUL_PROXY_PORT=8787
